# Only needed if you want to deploy to a real public testnet (Sepolia).
# Local development (npx hardhat node) needs none of this.

# Free RPC endpoint for Sepolia. Get one free from Alchemy or Infura:
#   https://www.alchemy.com/  or  https://www.infura.io/
SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=

# Private key of a wallet holding free Sepolia test ETH (NOT a real wallet
# with real funds). Get free Sepolia ETH from a faucet, e.g.:
#   https://sepoliafaucet.com/
# NEVER commit a real private key. This file is gitignored on purpose.
PRIVATE_KEY=
